        "operationId" : "createClaimDevicesJob",
        "summary" : "Requests creation of a new job.",
        "description" : "Requests creation of a job. The invoking user is called 'delegator'. At each time, there can be at most one executing job in the account. This request returns a 400 error status if this limit is exceeded; retry later.<h4>Required rights:</h4> <table><thead><tr><th>Right</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>JOB_MODIFY</td><td>Right for creating and modifying jobs.</td></tr><tbody></table>",
