        "operationId" : "getClaimDevicesItem",
        "summary" : "Job details and state.",
        "description" : "Retrieves the details and state of the job. The response provides some of the properties only in specific states, see the schema description.<h4>Required rights:</h4> <table><thead><tr><th>Right</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>JOB_READ</td><td>Right to read job information.</td></tr><tbody></table>",
